--- Master GUI manager coordinating the MyGUI rendering framework, viewport scaling, mouse cursor states, main HUD bars, floating window lifecycles, and context menus. Interacts directly with `MainBarGUI` for bottom HUD control bars and portraits, `InventoryGUI` for character, container, and shop barter layouts, `DatapanelGUI` for character and building telemetry readouts, `ToolTip` for hovering item inspections, `CharacterEditWindow` for character creation morphs, and `ScreenLabelInterface` for 3D floating damage and dialogue labels.
