--- Political superstructure governing diplomatic reputation scores, sovereign territorial biomes, military squad rosters, law enforcement alliances, economic trade cultures, and war campaigns. Interacts directly with `FactionManager` for global faction registration, `Platoon` for military and civilian squad simulation, `Character` for individual entity allegiance, `FactionRelations` for pairwise diplomatic standings, `FactionWarMgr` for military assaults, `TradeCulture` for contraband and tariffs, and `FactionLeader` for political leadership hierarchies.
---@class Faction
--- Pairwise diplomatic reputation score table.
---@field relations FactionRelations|nil
