--- Discrete 2D spatial inventory container grid managing item tile placement, cell occupancy bitmaps, equipment slot validation, stack bonuses, backpack weight reductions, and event callbacks. Each `InventorySection` belongs to a parent `Inventory` instance and coordinates directly with `Item` instances, `Character` equipment slots, and `RaceLimiter` gear restriction rules.
