--- Primary entity actor representing all humanoid and creature characters across the game world. Coordinates AI execution, combat, movement, anatomical damage, inventories, equipment, physics ragdolls, perception, and dialogues. Interacts directly with `MedicalSystem` for anatomical limb damage and vital hitpoints, `CharStats` for attributes and skill calculations, `AI` for Goal-Oriented Action Planning and jobs, `CombatClass` for melee combat execution, `RangedCombatClass` for crossbow targeting, `Inventory` for equipment slots and items, `CharMovement` for locomotion pathfinding, `CharBody` for visual mesh and detached limbs, and `Platoon` for squad membership and command structures.
