--- Base settlement entity representing villages, ruins, creature nests, and bandit camps. Coordinates territorial coverage, resident populations, faction ownership, and town alert levels. Interacts directly with `TownBuildingsManager` for town infrastructure and structural building registration, `BasePopulationManager` for squad spawning and resident counts, `ZoneMap` for spatial terrain chunk coverage, `NestBatcher` for procedural creature nest geometry, and `Faction` for diplomatic alignments and town ownership.
