--- Attribute, combat skill, racial bonus, damage curve, and experience points (XP) calculation engine for `Character` actors. Manages primary attributes (Strength, Dexterity, Toughness, Perception) and secondary proficiencies (Martial Arts, Melee Attack/Defence, Weapon proficiencies, Athletics, Stealth, Thievery, Crafting, Medicine, Crossbows, and Turrets). Governs movement dynamics (run speed, encumbrance penalties, swim speed, stealth speed), combat speed (attack/block timing, weapon weight penalties), damage scaling (cut, blunt, pierce, bleed), environmental weather hazard protection, and experience event dispatching. Coordinates directly with `Character` for entity state, `MedicalSystem` for health and wound penalties, `Inventory` for weight encumbrance, and `CombatClass` for attack selection and damage resolution.
---@class CharStats
--- Returns the character's thieving skill value.
---@field getThieving fun(self: CharStats): number
