---@field unarmedEncumbrancePenalty fun(self: CharStats): integer
--- Computes net martial arts bonus/penalty value for UI display, optionally factoring environment.
---@field skillBonusUnarmed_forGUI fun(self: CharStats, factorEnvironment?: boolean): integer
--- Computes net melee attack modifier for UI display.
---@field skillBonusAttack_melee fun(self: CharStats, factorEnvironment?: boolean): integer
--- Computes net unarmed attack modifier for UI display.
---@field skillBonusAttack_unarmed fun(self: CharStats, factorEnvironment?: boolean): integer
--- Computes net melee defence modifier for UI display.
---@field skillBonusDefence fun(self: CharStats, factorEnvironment?: boolean): integer
