--- Law enforcement, criminal offense, and judicial bounty manager in Kenshi. Embedded within `Character::crimes`. Manages active faction bounties (`bounties`), witnessed criminal infractions (`committingCrime`, `crimeExpiry`), sovereign law-enforcement delegation (`_getBountyFaction`), temporary access authorizations (`_hasAccessPass`, `accessPassExpirationTime`), judicial incarceration sentencing (`prisonSentenceToServe`, `prisonSentenceBeganTime`), and police visual recognition thresholds (`getBountyRecognitionThreshold`).
