---@field updateRace fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Updates and blends all skeletal vertex poses across the character mesh based on current posture slider values.
---@field updateCharacterPoses fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Clears and resets all active vertex poses and posture animation tracks on the preview character.
---@field clearCharacterPoses fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Switches the active character in the 3D preview platform, updating the character index label (`txtCharIdx`) and refreshing all sliders and labels.
---@field updateCharacter fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
