--- Governs: - **Anatomy & Damage Types**: Cut damage (bleeding & bandage degeneration), Blunt damage (stun), Wear damage (robotics degradation), and Acid/Weather erosion. - **Bleeding & Blood Loss**: Dynamic bleed rates, blood pool splattering, and blood loss coma (`pointOfCollapseBloodloss`). - **Consciousness & Recovery**: Shock knockout thresholds, recovery timers (`knockoutTimer`), coma states (`pointOfNoReturn`), and waking up (`canGetUpWakeUp`). - **Dismemberment & Prosthetics**: Limbs severed (`amputate`), crushed (`crushLimb`), or replaced with robotic prosthetics (`RobotLimbs`). - **Medical Treatment**: First aid bandaging (`applyFirstAid`), bone splinting (`applyDoctoring`), and robotic repair (`applyRigging`). - **Nutrition & Starvation**: Calorie depletion (`hunger`, `fed`), starvation speed penalties, and starvation coma.
---@class MedicalSystem
