--- Static definition and AI planner metadata for a task type (TaskType), including GOAP state requirements, state results, scoring function, and job characteristics.
---@class TaskData
--- Configures task behavior flags: aggression (0 = normal, 1 = aggressive, -1 = peaceful), aid (0 = normal, 1 = helpful, -1 = mean), noisy (0 = normal, 1 = loud, -1 = stealthy), unstoppable, hasStages, and leadsToSomething.
---@field setCharacteristics fun(self: TaskData, _aid: number, _aggressionLevel: number, noise: number, leadsSomewhere?: boolean)
--- Marks this task to evaluate AI goals less frequently.
---@field setInfrequentGoalChecks fun(self: TaskData)
--- Sets the sensory alertness multiplier (m) while performing this task.
---@field setAlertnessMult fun(self: TaskData, a: number)
--- Marks this task so failing its state requirements mid-execution will not abort the action early.
---@field setRequirementsCantEndActionPrematurely fun(self: TaskData, on?: boolean)
--- Sets the influence weight (m) encouraging nearby squadmates to copy this task.
---@field setCopyMeInfluence fun(self: TaskData, weight: number)
--- Sets the weight (w) encouraging followers to accompany a leader performing this task.
---@field setFollowMeWeight fun(self: TaskData, weight: number)
--- Enables self-regulation so AI characters do not all choose this task simultaneously.
---@field setSelfRegulation fun(self: TaskData, requirements?: boolean, results?: boolean)
--- Configures this task as duration-based with minimum duration min, random variance fuzz, and whether the task ends when time expires.
---@field setDurationBased fun(self: TaskData, mintime: number, fuzz: number, _endsAfterTime?: boolean)
--- Returns true if this task uses infrequent goal checks.
---@field hasInfrequentGoalChecks fun(self: TaskData): boolean
--- Returns true if failing state requirements cannot end this task prematurely.
---@field getRequirementsCantEndActionPrematurely fun(self: TaskData): boolean
--- Returns true if this task can be assigned as a permanent job.
---@field isPermaJob fun(self: TaskData): boolean
--- Returns true if this permanent job binds to a fixed target object.
---@field isPermaJobFixedTarget fun(self: TaskData): boolean
--- Returns the primary associated TaskType when used as a permanent job.
---@field getPermaJobAssociation fun(self: TaskData): integer
--- Returns the secondary associated TaskType when used as a permanent job.
---@field getPermaJobAssociation_secondary fun(self: TaskData): integer
--- Returns true if this task dynamically searches for a target.
---@field isTargetFinder fun(self: TaskData): boolean
--- Associates dialogue delivery event e (EventTriggerEnum) with this task.
---@field setDialogueDeliveryTag fun(self: TaskData, d: integer)
--- Configures permanent job behavior (on, fixedTarget, primary associate task, and associate2 secondary task).
---@field setPermaJob fun(self: TaskData, on: integer, fixedTarget?: boolean, t: integer, secondary: integer)
--- Returns the canonical TaskType used when storing this task as a permanent job.
---@field getPermaJobType fun(self: TaskData): integer
--- Pointer to the C++ target-finder function object (exposed as read-only lightuserdata).
---@field _findTarget lightuserdata
--- Whether unmet requirements are prevented from aborting the task once started.
---@field _requirementsCantEndActionPrematurely boolean
--- Whether this task's GOAP results always evaluate to false.
---@field _resultsAlwaysFalse boolean
--- Aggression classification (0 = normal, 1 = aggressive, -1 = peaceful).
---@field aggressionLevel number
--- Altruism classification (0 = normal, 1 = helpful, -1 = hostile/mean).
---@field aidLevel number
--- Multiplier applied to sensory alertness while executing this task.
---@field alertnessMult number
--- Whether progress on this task can be completed across multiple stages.
---@field canDoTaskInStages boolean
--- Weight influencing nearby AI characters to copy this task.
---@field copyMeInfluence number
